kwin-effect-upscale (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Every setting is a global default with an optional per-application
    override. The method is chosen per presentation - Wayland and X11,
    fullscreen, borderless and windowed - and Auto finds one by itself.
  * Applications are recognized by their program path and their window
    class and instance, each compared exactly, as a substring or as a
    regular expression.
  * The settings page is laid out as one form, and its application list
    can be reordered and shows which open windows an entry matches.
  * Settings stored by 0.1.0 snapshots are read under their old meaning
    and rewritten in the new form when the settings page is applied.
  * X11 resolution requests hold on KWin 6.6.

 -- Jens Koehler <kwin-effect-upscale@koehler-speyer.de>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0200

